+SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-6527-IMMUTABLE-ROWS,
+SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-6527-LIVE-RECHECK,
+SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-6527-RETIRED-DEPENDENCIES,
+SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-6527-TERMINAL.
+"""
